{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:14:14.414Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"37f624f86fdd73add3f2af8a9ca33d523f7826629b40b7b807a3dfc049a17f80","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@ruth.calloway, correction to my last reply on Orlavine Medical Supply. The 3/10/2025 digest calls Orlavine \"Nadia's medical account\", and the 9/15/2025 digest mentions a medical account Gideon took over in August without naming it. The later digests (12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026) do call Gideon's account a medical account, but they don't name Orlavine. So the owner is Gideon, but the link to Orlavine is unconfirmed; please check the CRM.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
